[I] Library for asynchronous I/O readiness notification

[T] ivykis is a C library for asynchronous I/O readiness notification,
[T] providing an event loop on top of epoll, kqueue, poll and similar
[T] mechanisms. It also offers timers, signal handling, thread pools and
[T] inter-thread events and is used by syslog-ng.

[U] https://libivykis.sourceforge.net

[A] Ivykis Authors
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

